---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Service Areas
lead: We serve homeowners across Greater Orlando — Orange, Seminole, Lake, and Osceola counties.
eyebrow: Where We Work
permalink: /service-areas/
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Cities We Cover</span>
      <h2>Central Florida Service Area</h2>
      <p>Not sure if we come to you? Call — if we can get there, we will.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="area-grid">
      {% for city in areas.list %}
      <div class="area-chip">{{ city }}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:600px;margin:40px auto 0;background:var(--charcoal);padding:36px;text-align:center;">
      <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;">Don't see your city?</h3>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin-bottom:24px;">Give us a call — we'll let you know if we can make it out to you.</p>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--amber btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
